      <p><seg source="#source-562-658">此度曽根拙蔵お土佐商会より御在番役所までさし立申候。宜御引合セ可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-658-670">レ</note><seg source="#source-670-673">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-673-685">レ</note><seg source="#source-685-742">遣候。何分飯田先生にもよろしく御相談可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-742-754">レ</note><seg source="#source-754-757">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-757-769">レ</note><seg source="#source-769-781">遣候。草</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-781-814">〻</g><seg source="#source-814-825">頓首。</seg></p>
